        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Saulo na Nogi wa Endoli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu shikū jenījo a Bafilisiti būkuminga mabità gabo kwilwisha būlūgū nabo a Baisilaeli. Ū Akishi ūng'wīla ū Daūdi, “Shikwigeleelilwe ūdeebe gīkī ū bebe na a banhū bako mukūbiza hamò nane ū kū būlūgū.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daūdi nang'hwe ūshosha alīhaya, “Būgatū a henaho h'ūkūbona ūmo akīītīlaga ū ntūmami wako. Ū Akishi ūhaya, Yabeela, nīyo ū bebe ūkūbiza nang'hani wane wa shikū jose.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu shikū jenījo ū Sang'weli walī wamala kūcha, a Baisilaeli a bose būnīla, na kūnjīka mu nzengo gwa Lama ūko wikalaga. Ū Saulo walī wabapeeja a balogi na a bachūja, bīnga mo ū mu sī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a Bafilisiti bibilinga, biza kūtūūla ng'hambī yabo Shunemu; ū Saulo nang'hwe ūbabilinga pye a Baisilaeli ūtūūla ng'hambī yakwe Giliboa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Saulo aho wagabona a mabità ga Bafilisiti, ogoha no ūyūdetema ū mu ng'holò kūlwa nguno ya boobà. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wamūūja ū SEEBA atanshokegije mhayo gose gose, ībize mu nzīla ya shilooti nūūlū kūtūmamīla Ulimu, nūūlū nzīla ya bahangi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A henaho ū Saulo ūbawīla a batūmami bakwe, “Nikoobelagi nkīma nchūja, naje koi nakīlole kwenūko ī nzīla yane!” Būng'wīla, “Alīho ūmò akikalaga Endoli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Saulo ūzwala shizwalo shingī nasho sha kūng'wīta ajimīlīkane; mu makanza ga būjikū ūja ū kūlī nkīma ng'wenūyo na banhū babīlī. Aho washika ūhaya, “Nitanīlage isamvwa lya būchūja, ūneenhele munhū ūyo nalakūwīle.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū nkīma ng'wenūyo ūng'wīla, “Baba tūhaya nang'ho wīmanile a hene īyo wīyīta ū Saulo; ī gīkī a balogi na a bachūja wabamala kūbabūlaga ū mu sī yenīyī! Nibūlī ūlībūtūūlīla ntego gwabūbi gīko ū būpanga wane, ūningīje mu kūcha?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Saulo ūng'wilahīlīla ū nkīma ng'wenūyo mu lina lya ng'wa SEEBA; ūhaya, “Nalīkwilahīlīla mu lina lya ng'wa SEEBA mpanga gīkī, ūtūūpandīka nsango kūlwa nguno ya mhayo gwenūyū.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū nkīma ūmūūja, “Nani ūyo nakwenhele?” Nang'hwe ūhaya, “Nenhelage Sang'weli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nkīma ng'wenūyo aho wamona ū Sang'weli, ūlīla na'ilaka lya higūlya alīng'wīla ū Saulo, “Nibūlī wanilemba baba alīyo gashi ū bebe h'ūlī Saulo!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi ūng'wīla, “Īnjaga ū boobà, ūlībona kī?” Ū nkīma ūhaya, “Nalīmona Mulungu wagulumūka kūfuma mu gatī ya sī!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ūbūūja, “Alī na suso kī?” Ū nkīma ūhaya, “Ūūyo namhala wagulumūka, aliza azwalile ng'hanjo.” Ū Saulo ūng'witegeleja gīkī hū ng'wene ū Sang'weli, na lūūlū ūtuja mazwi, winama kūshisha ū būshū būkuumya hasī.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Saulo kūwīlwa mihayo na Sang'weli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Sang'weli ūng'wīla ū Saulo, “Nibūlī wanikoya koya kūshisha kūnenha kūūnū?” Ū Saulo ūshosha alīhaya, “Ī haha nalī mu makoye madito no, a Bafilisiti baanidumīlile kwilwisha būlūgū naane; alīyo ū Mulungu wanilekile, ooyile ū kūnishokeja mhayo mu nzīla yose yose, ībize ya bahangi nūūlū ya shilooti. H'ī nguno yene naabona nakwitane bebe ūniwīle ū gwa kwīta.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sang'weli nang'hwe ūnshokeja alīng'wīla, “Ū nene ūlīnibūūja kūkooba kī, īkī wakūlekile ū SEEBA, ūgalūka kūbiza ng'wanishi wako? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA wagūshikīlīgije ūyo walī wagūhaya mu nzīla yane. Ū SEEBA wabūtandūlile ū būtemi ūwīnja ū mu nkono gwako, ūng'winha nzenganwa ng'wiyo, Daūdi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī haha ū SEEBA alīkwītīla ī yenīyo kūlwa nguno ūkaleka ū kūng'wigwa, ūlemeelwa ū kūbashikīlīgīja a Baamaleki kūlenganīla nū būpelanu wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA akūkūtūūla mu makono ga Bafilisiti ū bebe, hamò na a Baisilaeli. Nīyo ī ntondo ū bebe na a bitūnja bako mukūbiza hamò naane; nī libità lya Baisilaeli ū SEEBA akūlītūūla mu makono ga Bafilisiti.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Saulo ūgwa loolo ū mīlī, kūlwa nguno ya mihayo ya ng'wa Sang'weli; yūng'ogohya no, ūgwa pu hasī haho na haho ūgololoka henaho. Walī atī na nguzu gete nguno walī ataliile ī līīmi lya lūshikū lwenūlo, nī būjikū yaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nkīma ng'wenūyo wiza aho walī ū Saulo, aho wamona ūmo walī ogohela ūng'wīla; “Baba ūlībona gīkī ū nene ntūmami wako naalī naakūdegeleka, nūbūdiimīīla mu nkono ū būpanga wane nīta gīt'ūmo walī waniwīlīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū baba nalīkwikūmbīlīja nang'ho ī haha ūndegeleke ū ntūmami wako; ūzunye nakūbeegeje shilīwa ūlye ūpandīke nguzu, ūdūle kūshimīza ūje.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū wei ūlema ūhaya, “Yaya natūūlyaga!” Alīyo a banhū bakwe būdimana nū nkīma ng'wenūyo; bandya kūnganikīla kūshisha nose ūbigwa, ūbūūka a hasī wigasha hisumbī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nkīma ng'wenūyo akasangwa alī na mūūga ya ng'ombe ng'īnu a ha ng'wakwe; wīsīnza haho na haho, ūsola na būsu ūbūluba, ūbeja migatī ya būsu būtī na shibimbya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūntengela ū Saulo na a banhū bakwe, būlya. Ū būjikū wenūbo būbūūka būja.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
